h from `i915` to `xe` drivers between the two distinct AI contexts (Opus and Sonnet).\n- Technical analyses and benchmark tables were consolidated into evidence files, documenting perplexity A/B tests and GRF llama-bench attempts to validate the tuning parameters.\n- The session concluded with a comprehensive issues ledger, recording mistakes, decisions, and open items, including a final write"}